{"question_id": "V2-dev-LAW-en-T2-001", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "L", "corpus_set": "LAW_en", "answer_text": "Yes. The Bribery Act 2010 applies because the person is a British citizen (a close connection with the United Kingdom) and the act is a bribery of a foreign public official.  \n1. The act is a bribery of a foreign public official under section 6(1) – the official is a French minister.  \n2. The person intends to influence the official in his capacity as a foreign public official, satisfying section 6(1).  \n3. The person is a British citizen, so he has a close connection with the United Kingdom, satisfying section 12(6)(c).  \n4. The offence is therefore a section 6 offence (bribery of a foreign public official) under the Bribery Act 2010.", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 166 chars]", "doc_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en", "section_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::o010", "unit_ids": ["L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::p1_b67"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [6284, 6450], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 43 chars]", "doc_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en", "section_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::o010", "unit_ids": ["L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::p1_b68"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [6452, 6495], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 16 chars]", "doc_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en", "section_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::o010", "unit_ids": ["L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::p1_b69"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [6497, 6513], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 209 chars]", "doc_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en", "section_id": "L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::o010", "unit_ids": ["L.ukpga-2010-23_bribery-act.en::p1_b80"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 3, "span": [7335, 7544], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 112 chars]", "doc_id": "L.ukpg