{"question_id": "V2-dev-LAW-en-T2-002", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "L", "corpus_set": "LAW_en", "answer_text": "The contract may impose a notice period of up to **two months** before the switching process can begin.  \nAfter that notice, the actual transition must be completed within **30 calendar days**.  \nBecause the request is made in March 2026, the provider may charge a **reduced switching fee** that must not exceed the provider’s direct switching‑related costs.  \n\n- Article 25(d): maximum notice period two months.  \n- Article 25(a): mandatory maximum transitional period 30 calendar days.  \n- Article 29(2): reduced switching charges allowed 11 Jan 2024‑12 Jan 2027.  \n- Article 29(3): reduced charges cannot exceed direct switching costs.", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 103 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o035", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b458"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [225004, 225107], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 1264 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o035", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b455"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [223108, 224372], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 161 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o039", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b483"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [229917, 230078], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 200 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o039", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b484"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 3, "span": [230080, 230280], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[strippe