{"question_id": "V2-dev-LAW-en-T2-003", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "L", "corpus_set": "LAW_en", "answer_text": "No, it cannot be registered.  \n- Article 18(2)(c) requires the entity to “be legally independent from any entity that operates on a for‑profit basis.”  \n- The foundation is legally controlled by a for‑profit pharmaceutical group, so it fails this requirement.  \n\nFor an entity that does qualify and has supplied all required information:  \n- Article 19(5) states the competent authority must register the entity “within 12 weeks after the receipt of the application for registration.”  \n- The registration is “valid in all Member States.”", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 126 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o026", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b280"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [135831, 135957], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 117 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o026", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b283"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [136150, 136267], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 516 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o027", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b303"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [139504, 140020], "meta": {}}], "evidence_units": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b280", "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b283", "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b303"], "evidence_items": [{"doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R08